{"id": "7g8AVuYdHnmF", "owner": "showcase", "title": "ORACLE-7 — Autonomous Agent Console", "createdAt": 1790349205516, "updatedAt": 1790349397330, "versions": [{"prompt": "AI agent console \"Oracle-7\" — hacker terminal aesthetic, streaming log lines, agent status cards, tasks queue, a pulsing neural-network graph in SVG. Visual theme (follow strictly): near-black background (#050b09), neon green #39ff14 and electric blue #5bd1ff as the ONLY accent colors, subtle pixel-grid / scanline texture, glowing edges and soft neon bloom, bold grotesk headings with monospace details, futuristic cyber-crypto aesthetic. Desktop 1440px wide, fill the first screen with the hero.", "html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>ORACLE-7 — Autonomous Agent Console</title>\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n:root{\n  --bg:#0b0509;\n  --panel:#0f070c;\n  --panel-2:#130810;\n  --green:#8c14ff;\n  --blue:#ff5b64;\n  --ink:#f7d8f3;\n  --dim:#8c6e83;\n  --line:rgba(140,20,255,.16);\n  --line-b:rgba(255,91,100,.18);\n  --mono:'JetBrains Mono',ui-monospace,monospace;\n  --sans:'Space Grotesk',system-ui,sans-serif;\n}\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0}\nhtml{scroll-behavior:smooth}\nbody{\n  background:var(--bg);\n  color:var(--ink);\n  font-family:var(--sans);\n  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;\n  overflow-x:hidden;\n  line-height:1.5;\n}\n/* ---------- texture layers ---------- */\nbody::before{\n  content:\"\";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:1;\n  background-image:\n    linear-gradient(rgba(140,20,255,.045) 1px,transparent 1px),\n    linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(140,20,255,.045) 1px,transparent 1px);\n  background-size:32px 32px;\n  mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse 110% 85% at 50% 18%,#000000 25%,transparent 92%);\n}\nbody::after{\n  content:\"\";position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:60;\n  background:repeating-linear-gradient(to bottom,rgba(0,0,0,0) 0 2px,rgba(0,0,0,.28) 2px 3px);\n  mix-blend-mode:multiply;opacity:.55;\n}\n.bloom{position:fixed;inset:0;pointer-events:none;z-index:0;overflow:hidden}\n.bloom i{position:absolute;display:block;border-radius:50%;filter:blur(90px);opacity:.30}\n.bloom i:nth-child(1){width:620px;height:620px;left:-180px;top:-200px;background:#620d6b}\n.bloom i:nth-child(2){width:680px;height:680px;right:-220px;top:-120px;background:#750e0a}\n.bloom i:nth-child(3){width:520px;height:520px;left:38%;bottom:-320px;background:#5c0b4e;opacity:.22}\n.wrap{position:relative;z-index:2;max-width:1440px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}\n\n/* ---------- nav ---------- */\nheader.nav{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:40;backdrop-filter:blur(10px);\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(11,5,9,.94),rgba(11,5,9,.55));\n  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.nav-in{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:28px;height:68px}\n.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;text-decoration:none;color:var(--ink)}\n.mark{width:30px;height:30px;flex:none;filter:drop-shadow(0 0 8px rgba(140,20,255,.6))}\n.brand b{font-size:17px;letter-spacing:.14em;font-weight:700}\n.brand span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.22em;display:block;line-height:1}\n.nav nav{display:flex;gap:26px;margin-left:auto}\n.nav nav a{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim);text-decoration:none;transition:.2s}\n.nav nav a:hover{color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(140,20,255,.7)}\n.pill{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.12em;border:1px solid var(--line);\n  padding:7px 13px;border-radius:999px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;color:var(--green);\n  background:rgba(140,20,255,.05)}\n.dot{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--green);animation:blip 1.6s infinite}\n@keyframes blip{0%,100%{opacity:1}50%{opacity:.25}}\n\n/* ---------- hero ---------- */\n.hero{min-height:calc(100vh - 68px);display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;padding:44px 0 34px}\n.hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.02fr .98fr;gap:56px;align-items:center}\n.eyebrow{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.3em;color:var(--blue);text-transform:uppercase;\n  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;margin-bottom:26px}\n.eyebrow::before{content:\"\";width:46px;height:1px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),transparent)}\nh1{font-size:clamp(44px,5.6vw,86px);line-height:.94;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin:0 0 24px;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase}\nh1 .glow{color:var(--green);text-shadow:0 0 26px rgba(140,20,255,.45),0 0 70px rgba(140,20,255,.18)}\nh1 .out{color:transparent;-webkit-text-stroke:1.4px rgba(255,91,100,.75)}\n.lede{font-size:17px;color:#c49fbb;max-width:52ch;margin:0 0 32px}\n.lede b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}\n.cta{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:38px}\n.btn{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;padding:14px 26px;\n  text-decoration:none;border:1px solid var(--green);color:#0f0410;background:var(--green);font-weight:700;\n  box-shadow:0 0 0 rgba(140,20,255,.6);transition:.25s;clip-path:polygon(10px 0,100% 0,100% calc(100% - 10px),calc(100% - 10px) 100%,0 100%,0 10px)}\n.btn:hover{box-shadow:0 0 28px rgba(140,20,255,.55);transform:translateY(-2px)}\n.btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--blue);border-color:var(--line-b)}\n.btn.ghost:hover{border-color:var(--blue);box-shadow:0 0 24px rgba(255,91,100,.3);color:#ffcdcd}\n.stats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-top:1px solid var(--line);border-left:1px solid var(--line)}\n.stat{border-right:1px solid var(--line);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);padding:16px 14px}\n.stat b{display:block;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:24px;color:var(--green);letter-spacing:-.02em;text-shadow:0 0 18px rgba(140,20,255,.35)}\n.stat span{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase}\n\n/* panel base */\n.panel{position:relative;background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(22,9,17,.9),rgba(11,5,9,.9));\n  border:1px solid var(--line);backdrop-filter:blur(3px)}\n.panel::before,.panel::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;width:10px;height:10px;border:1px solid var(--green);opacity:.7}\n.panel::before{left:-1px;top:-1px;border-right:0;border-bottom:0}\n.panel::after{right:-1px;bottom:-1px;border-left:0;border-top:0}\n.p-head{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;padding:11px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--dim)}\n.p-head strong{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.2em}\n.p-head .right{margin-left:auto;color:var(--blue)}\n\n/* graph */\n.graph-panel{padding:0}\n.graph-panel svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}\n.gfoot{display:flex;gap:18px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase}\n.gfoot i{width:8px;height:8px;display:inline-block;border-radius:50%;margin-right:7px;vertical-align:1px}\n\n/* hero ticker */\n.ticker{margin-top:30px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(12,4,10,.8);\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0;overflow:hidden}\n.ticker .tag{background:var(--green);color:#0f0410;padding:9px 14px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;flex:none}\n.ticker .track{white-space:nowrap;animation:slide 34s linear infinite;padding-left:100%;color:#b78fac}\n.ticker .track em{color:var(--blue);font-style:normal}\n.ticker .track s{color:var(--green);text-decoration:none}\n@keyframes slide{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(-100%)}}\n\n/* ---------- console section ---------- */\nsection{padding:86px 0}\n.sec-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-end;gap:24px;margin-bottom:30px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(28px,3.2vw,42px);margin:0;letter-spacing:-.03em;text-transform:uppercase;line-height:1}\n.sec-head p{margin:0 0 4px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase}\n.sec-head .idx{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.2em}\n\n.console{display:grid;grid-template-columns:320px 1fr 330px;gap:22px;align-items:start}\n\n/* agents */\n.agent{padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:rgba(16,7,13,.75);margin-bottom:14px;transition:.25s}\n.agent:hover{border-color:rgba(140,20,255,.45);box-shadow:0 0 30px rgba(140,20,255,.08);transform:translateX(3px)}\n.agent .top{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:10px}\n.agent .av{width:34px;height:34px;flex:none;border:1px solid var(--line-b);display:grid;place-items:center;\n  font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;color:var(--blue);background:rgba(255,91,100,.06)}\n.agent h4{margin:0;font-size:14.5px;letter-spacing:.02em}\n.agent .role{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase}\n.chip{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.14em;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:999px;text-transform:uppercase}\n.chip.run{color:var(--green);border:1px solid rgba(140,20,255,.4);background:rgba(140,20,255,.07)}\n.chip.idle{color:var(--dim);border:1px solid rgba(140,110,131,.4)}\n.chip.sync{color:var(--blue);border:1px solid rgba(255,91,100,.4);background:rgba(255,91,100,.07)}\n.meter{height:4px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);overflow:hidden;margin-top:4px}\n.meter i{display:block;height:100%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--blue),var(--green));\n  box-shadow:0 0 12px rgba(140,20,255,.6);transition:width .9s cubic-bezier(.4,0,.2,1)}\n.mrow{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--dim);letter-spacing:.12em;margin-top:9px}\n.mrow b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:500}\n.spark{display:block;width:100%;height:28px;margin-top:8px}\n\n/* log */\n.log-body{height:520px;overflow:hidden;padding:10px 0;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12.2px;position:relative}\n.log-body::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;top:0;height:46px;\n  background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(11,5,9,.95),transparent);pointer-events:none}\n.log-line{display:grid;grid-template-columns:78px 62px 104px 1fr;gap:10px;padding:3px 14px;\n  animation:fade .4s ease both;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden}\n.log-line:hover{background:rgba(140,20,255,.05)}\n@keyframes fade{from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(6px)}to{opacity:1;transform:none}}\n.t{color:#6b4560}\n.lv{font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.06em}\n.lv.ok{color:var(--green)}.lv.inf{color:var(--blue)}.lv.wrn{color:#8a8bff}.lv.exe{color:#f29cff}\n.ag{color:#d6817f}\n.msg{color:#bf9db6;text-overflow:ellipsis;overflow:hidden}\n.msg u{text-decoration:none;color:var(--green)}\n.log-foot{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:10px 14px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:12px;color:var(--green)}\n.caret{width:8px;height:15px;background:var(--green);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--green);animation:blip 1s steps(1) infinite}\n\n/* queue */\n.task{padding:13px 14px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n.task:last-child{border-bottom:0}\n.task .l1{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:6px}\n.task .id{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:var(--blue);letter-spacing:.1em}\n.task h5{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.01em}\n.task .pct{margin-left:auto;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;color:var(--green)}\n.prio{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.16em;padding:3px 7px;border:1px solid var(--line-b);color:var(--blue)}\n.prio.hi{color:var(--green);border-color:rgba(140,20,255,.45)}\n.q-add{padding:12px 14px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;\n  color:var(--dim);display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center}\n.q-add b{color:var(--green)}\n\n/* capabilities */\n.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px}\n.card{padding:26px 22px 24px;border:1px solid var(--line);background:linear-gradient(170deg,rgba(22,9,17,.85),rgba(11,5,9,.6));transition:.3s;position:relative;overflow:hidden}\n.card:hover{border-color:rgba(255,91,100,.45);transform:translateY(-4px);box-shadow:0 18px 50px -20px rgba(140,20,255,.3)}\n.card svg{margin-bottom:18px}\n.card h3{margin:0 0 9px;font-size:18px;letter-spacing:-.01em}\n.card p{margin:0;font-size:13.5px;color:#aa89a1;line-height:1.6}\n.card .no{position:absolute;top:14px;right:16px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10px;color:#4b2f42}\n\n/* protocol strip */\n.strip{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);border:1px solid var(--line)}\n.strip div{padding:28px 26px;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}\n.strip div:last-child{border-right:0}\n.strip .k{font-family:var(--mono);font-size:10.5px;letter-spacing:.24em;color:var(--blue);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:12px}\n.strip p{margin:0;font-size:14px;color:#c49fbb}\n.strip code{color:var(--green);font-family:var(--mono);font-size:13px}\n\n/* cta band */\n.band{border:1px solid var(--line);padding:56px 48px;text-align:center;position:relative;overflow:hidden;\n  background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 120%,rgba(140,20,255,.14),transparent 60%)}\n.band h2{font-size:clamp(30px,4.4vw,58px);margin:0 0 16px;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1}\n.band p{margin:0 auto 28px;max-width:56ch;color:#c49fbb;font-size:16px}\nfooter{border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:28px 0 46px;font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;\n  letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--dim);display:flex;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;text-transform:uppercase}\nfooter span:last-child{margin-left:auto}\nfooter a{color:var(--dim);text-decoration:none}\nfooter a:hover{color:var(--green)}\n\n@media (max-width:1180px){\n  .console{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}\n  .queue-col{grid-column:1/-1}\n  .cards{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}\n}\n@media (max-width:900px){\n  .wrap{padding:0 20px}\n  .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:34px}\n  .hero{min-height:auto;padding:38px 0}\n  .nav nav{display:none}\n  .console{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  .strip{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  .strip div{border-right:0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}\n  .log-line{grid-template-columns:66px 52px 1fr;font-size:11.5px}\n  .log-line .ag{display:none}\n  section{padding:60px 0}\n}\n@media (max-width:480px){\n  .stats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}\n  .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}\n  .band{padding:38px 20px}\n}\n@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{animation:none!important;transition:none!important}}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<!--tr-cover-->\n<link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@400;700;800;900&family=Inter:wght@400;500;700&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n<style>\n.trc{--a:#ff3b6b;position:relative;z-index:1000;height:100vh;min-height:620px;overflow:hidden;background:#000;color:#fff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif;isolation:isolate}\n.trc-s{position:absolute;inset:-4%;background-size:cover;background-position:center;opacity:0;transition:opacity 1.4s ease;animation:trcKen 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate}\n.trc-s.on{opacity:1}\n@keyframes trcKen{from{transform:scale(1) translate3d(0,0,0)}to{transform:scale(1.09) translate3d(-1.5%,-1%,0)}}\n.trc::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(0,0,0,.55) 0%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 22%,rgba(0,0,0,0) 48%,rgba(0,0,0,.82) 100%)}\n.trc-nav{position:absolute;z-index:3;top:18px;left:24px;right:24px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;padding:10px 12px 10px 16px;border-radius:14px;background:rgba(10,10,12,.42);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);-webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12)}\n.trc-logo{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-weight:800;font-size:15px;letter-spacing:-.01em;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-logo i{width:26px;height:26px;border-radius:7px;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 22px var(--a);display:grid;place-items:center;font-style:normal;color:#000;font-size:13px;font-weight:900}\n.trc-links{display:flex;gap:22px;flex:1}\n.trc-links a{color:rgba(255,255,255,.78);text-decoration:none;font-size:13.5px;font-weight:500}\n.trc-links a:hover{color:#fff}\n.trc-btn{height:38px;padding:0 16px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.22);background:rgba(255,255,255,.06);color:#fff;font:600 13px Inter,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}\n.trc-btn.pri{background:var(--a);border-color:var(--a);color:#000;box-shadow:0 8px 28px -8px var(--a)}\n.trc-copy{position:absolute;z-index:3;left:48px;right:48px;bottom:56px;max-width:880px}\n.trc-chip{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:6px 12px;border-radius:999px;background:rgba(0,0,0,.45);border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.18);font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}\n.trc-chip b{width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--a);box-shadow:0 0 10px var(--a)}\n.trc h1{font-family:\"Syne\",Inter,sans-serif;font-weight:900;font-size:clamp(44px,9vw,150px);line-height:.9;white-space:nowrap;letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:18px 0 14px;text-shadow:0 8px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.45)}\n.trc h1 em{font-style:normal;color:var(--a)}\n.trc p{font-size:clamp(16px,1.6vw,20px);line-height:1.45;color:rgba(255,255,255,.86);max-width:560px;margin:0 0 24px}\n.trc-ctas{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n.trc-ctas .trc-btn{height:48px;padding:0 22px;font-size:14.5px;border-radius:12px}\n.trc-dots{position:absolute;z-index:3;right:48px;bottom:64px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;font:600 12px Inter,sans-serif;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75)}\n.trc-dots i{width:22px;height:3px;border-radius:3px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.3);transition:.4s}\n.trc-dots i.on{width:44px;background:var(--a)}\n.trc-dots span{margin-left:8px;letter-spacing:.08em}\n@media(max-width:760px){.trc-links{display:none}.trc-nav{left:12px;right:12px;gap:10px;justify-content:space-between}.trc-nav .trc-btn:not(.pri){display:none}.trc-copy{left:20px;right:20px;bottom:40px}.trc-dots{display:none}}\n</style>\n<section class=\"trc\" data-trc=\"agent\">\n  <div class=\"trc-s on\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/opengenerative-ui.jpg)\"></div><div class=\"trc-s\" style=\"background-image:url(/img/cover/chatgl.jpg)\"></div>\n  <nav class=\"trc-nav\"><div class=\"trc-logo\"><i>O</i>ORACLE-7</div><div class=\"trc-links\"><a href=\"#\">Console</a><a href=\"#\">Skills</a><a href=\"#\">Logs</a><a href=\"#\">API</a></div><button class=\"trc-btn\">Sign in</button><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Deploy agent</button></nav>\n  <div class=\"trc-copy\"><span class=\"trc-chip\"><b></b>AI agent · Robinhood Chain</span><h1><em>ORACLE-7</em></h1><p>An autonomous agent that watches, reasons and acts while you sleep.</p>\n    <div class=\"trc-ctas\"><button class=\"trc-btn pri\">Deploy agent</button><button class=\"trc-btn\">Learn more</button></div></div>\n  <div class=\"trc-dots\"><i class=on></i><i></i><span>01 / 02</span></div>\n</section>\n<script>(function(){var r=document.querySelector('[data-trc]'),s=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-s'),d=r.querySelectorAll('.trc-dots i'),n=r.querySelector('.trc-dots span'),k=0;\nfunction go(i){k=i%s.length;s.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});d.forEach(function(e,j){e.classList.toggle('on',j===k)});if(n)n.textContent='0'+(k+1)+' / 0'+s.length}\nvar h=/#s(\\d)/.exec(location.hash);if(h)go(+h[1]-1);else if(s.length>1)setInterval(function(){go(k+1)},5200);}());</script>\n<!--/tr-cover-->\n\n\n\n<div class=\"bloom\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>\n\n<header class=\"nav\">\n  <div class=\"wrap nav-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\">\n      <svg class=\"mark\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <path d=\"M16 2 29 9.5v13L16 30 3 22.5v-13z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8c14ff\" stroke-width=\"1.6\"/>\n        <path d=\"M16 8.5 23.5 13v9L16 26.5 8.5 22v-9z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff5b64\" stroke-width=\"1.2\" opacity=\".8\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"16\" cy=\"17\" r=\"3.1\" fill=\"#8c14ff\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <span style=\"display:block\"><b>ORACLE-7</b><span>AGENT&nbsp;CONSOLE</span></span>\n    </a>\n    <nav>\n      <a href=\"#console\">Console</a>\n      <a href=\"#capabilities\">Capabilities</a>\n      <a href=\"#protocol\">Protocol</a>\n      <a href=\"#deploy\">Deploy</a>\n    </nav>\n    <div class=\"pill\"><span class=\"dot\"></span>MESH ONLINE · 7/7</div>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"top\">\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <!-- ================= HERO ================= -->\n  <section class=\"hero\" style=\"padding-top:44px\">\n    <div class=\"hero-grid\">\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"eyebrow\">sys://oracle-7 · cluster alpha · build 7.4.21</div>\n        <h1>Run the<br><span class=\"glow\">swarm</span> <span class=\"out\">from</span><br>one terminal.</h1>\n        <p class=\"lede\">Oracle-7 is an <b>autonomous agent console</b>: spawn reasoning agents, watch every token they emit, and interrupt a chain-of-thought mid-execution. Full log transparency — <b>no black boxes</b>.</p>\n        <div class=\"cta\">\n          <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#console\">Open console</a>\n          <a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"#protocol\">Read the protocol</a>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"stats\">\n          <div class=\"stat\"><b data-count=\"7\" data-suffix=\"\">0</b><span>Agents live</span></div>\n          <div class=\"stat\"><b data-count=\"1.42\" data-suffix=\"M\">0</b><span>Tokens / min</span></div>\n          <div class=\"stat\"><b data-count=\"99.98\" data-suffix=\"%\">0</b><span>Mesh uptime</span></div>\n          <div class=\"stat\"><b data-count=\"12\" data-suffix=\"ms\">0</b><span>Hop latency</span></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"panel graph-panel\">\n        <div class=\"p-head\"><strong>Neural&nbsp;mesh</strong> · topology <span class=\"right\" id=\"pkt\">0 pkt/s</span></div>\n        <svg id=\"mesh\" viewBox=\"0 0 560 400\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Pulsing neural network graph of the Oracle-7 agent mesh\">\n          <defs>\n            <filter id=\"glow\" x=\"-120%\" y=\"-120%\" width=\"340%\" height=\"340%\">\n              <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"3.2\" result=\"b\"/>\n              <feMerge><feMergeNode in=\"b\"/><feMergeNode in=\"SourceGraphic\"/></feMerge>\n            </filter>\n            <radialGradient id=\"core\">\n              <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#f0e4ff\"/><stop offset=\"55%\" stop-color=\"#8c14ff\"/><stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#460d5b\"/>\n            </radialGradient>\n          </defs>\n          <g id=\"edges\"></g><g id=\"packets\"></g><g id=\"nodes\"></g>\n        </svg>\n        <div class=\"gfoot\">\n          <span><i style=\"background:#8c14ff;box-shadow:0 0 8px #8c14ff\"></i>Executor node</span>\n          <span><i style=\"background:#ff5b64;box-shadow:0 0 8px #ff5b64\"></i>Retrieval node</span>\n          <span style=\"margin-left:auto\">28 nodes · 61 links · depth 4</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"ticker\">\n      <span class=\"tag\">LIVE</span>\n      <div class=\"track\" id=\"tick\">\n        <s>ORACLE-7</s> &nbsp;//&nbsp; agent <em>VESPER</em> closed task Q-1182 in 4.21s &nbsp;·&nbsp; memory shard <em>0x8f41</em> compacted &nbsp;·&nbsp; <s>+1,402,880</s> tokens processed this cycle &nbsp;·&nbsp; guardrail <em>SAFE-EXEC</em> blocked 2 shell calls &nbsp;·&nbsp; new vector index built in 812ms &nbsp;·&nbsp; consensus reached by 5/7 agents on plan <em>ATLAS</em> &nbsp;·&nbsp; cold start avoided, warm pool <s>94%</s> &nbsp;·&nbsp;\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ================= CONSOLE ================= -->\n  <section id=\"console\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div>\n        <p>02 — Operations floor</p>\n        <h2>Everything the agents do, in real time</h2>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"idx\">/var/log/oracle7/stream.jsonl</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"console\">\n      <!-- agents -->\n      <div>\n        <div class=\"panel\" style=\"padding:14px\">\n          <div style=\"font-family:var(--mono);font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.2em;color:var(--dim);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:14px\">Agent&nbsp;roster</div>\n          <div id=\"agents\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- log -->\n      <div class=\"panel\">\n        <div class=\"p-head\"><span class=\"dot\"></span><strong>stream</strong> · tail -f <span class=\"right\" id=\"rate\">0 lines/s</span></div>\n        <div class=\"log-body\" id=\"log\" aria-live=\"polite\" aria-label=\"Streaming agent log\"></div>\n        <div class=\"log-foot\">oracle7@mesh:~$ <span id=\"cmd\"></span><span class=\"caret\"></span></div>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- queue -->\n      <div class=\"queue-col\">\n        <div class=\"panel\">\n          <div class=\"p-head\"><strong>Task&nbsp;queue</strong><span class=\"right\" id=\"qcount\">6 active</span></div>\n          <div id=\"queue\"></div>\n          <div class=\"q-add\">&gt; dispatch <b>--priority=high</b> _</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ================= CAPABILITIES ================= -->\n  <section id=\"capabilities\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div><p>03 — Runtime</p><h2>Built for agents that don't sleep</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"idx\">core/*</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cards\">\n      <article class=\"card\"><span class=\"no\">01</span>\n        <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8c14ff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" filter=\"url(#glow)\"><rect x=\"4\" y=\"4\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M11 17h5l2-5 3 10 2-5h1\" stroke=\"#ff5b64\"/></svg>\n        <h3>Deterministic replay</h3>\n        <p>Every plan, tool call and token is hashed into an append-only ledger. Rewind any run to the exact state it failed in.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card\"><span class=\"no\">02</span>\n        <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff5b64\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"12\"/><path d=\"M17 5v24M5 17h24\" opacity=\".5\"/><circle cx=\"17\" cy=\"17\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#8c14ff\" stroke=\"none\"/></svg>\n        <h3>Swarm consensus</h3>\n        <p>Seven agents vote before a destructive action ships. Quorum is configurable per tool, per environment.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card\"><span class=\"no\">03</span>\n        <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#8c14ff\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M17 3 5 9v9c0 7 5 11 12 13 7-2 12-6 12-13V9z\"/><path d=\"M12 17l4 4 7-8\" stroke=\"#ff5b64\"/></svg>\n        <h3>Sandboxed tools</h3>\n        <p>Shell, browser and repo access run inside ephemeral microVMs with egress allow-lists and 90-second TTLs.</p>\n      </article>\n      <article class=\"card\"><span class=\"no\">04</span>\n        <svg width=\"34\" height=\"34\" viewBox=\"0 0 34 34\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#ff5b64\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"><path d=\"M6 24V12M13 24V7M20 24v-9M27 24v-14\"/><path d=\"M4 28h26\" stroke=\"#8c14ff\"/></svg>\n        <h3>Token economics</h3>\n        <p>Per-agent budgets, live cost ceilings and automatic model downgrade when a task drifts past its allowance.</p>\n      </article>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ================= PROTOCOL ================= -->\n  <section id=\"protocol\">\n    <div class=\"sec-head\">\n      <div><p>04 — Protocol</p><h2>Three calls. That's the API.</h2></div>\n      <div class=\"idx\">oracle7 · v7.4</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"strip\">\n      <div><div class=\"k\">Spawn</div><p><code>POST /agents</code><br>Declare a role, a toolset and a budget. The mesh allocates a node and returns a live socket in under 40ms.</p></div>\n      <div><div class=\"k\">Observe</div><p><code>GET /stream?tail=1</code><br>A single JSONL feed of thoughts, tool invocations and results. Pipe it straight into your own console.</p></div>\n      <div><div class=\"k\">Intervene</div><p><code>POST /halt/:id</code><br>Freeze a chain mid-step, patch the context window, resume. No restart, no lost state.</p></div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- ================= CTA ================= -->\n  <section id=\"deploy\" style=\"padding-top:20px\">\n    <div class=\"band\">\n      <div class=\"eyebrow\" style=\"justify-content:center\">access tier · operator</div>\n      <h2>Deploy your first<br><span class=\"glow\" style=\"color:var(--green)\">agent mesh</span> tonight</h2>\n      <p>Free while the cluster is in open beta — 7 concurrent agents, 5M tokens per day, full log retention for 30 days. No card, no sales call.</p>\n      <div class=\"cta\" style=\"justify-content:center;margin-bottom:0\">\n        <a class=\"btn\" href=\"#top\">Request node key</a>\n        <a class=\"btn ghost\" href=\"#console\">View live console</a>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer>\n    <span>© 2025 Oracle-7 Labs</span>\n    <span><a href=\"#protocol\">Docs</a></span>\n    <span><a href=\"#capabilities\">Status</a></span>\n    <span><a href=\"#console\">Changelog</a></span>\n    <span>Region: eu-north-1 · latency 12ms</span>\n  </footer>\n</div>\n</main>\n\n<script>\nconst reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n\n/* ---------- animated stat counters ---------- */\ndocument.querySelectorAll('[data-count]').forEach(el=>{\n  const target = parseFloat(el.dataset.count), suf = el.dataset.suffix||'';\n  const dec = (target % 1 !== 0) ? 2 : 0;\n  if(reduce){ el.textContent = target.toFixed(dec)+suf; return; }\n  let s=null;\n  const step = t=>{ s=s||t; const p=Math.min((t-s)/1300,1); const e=1-Math.pow(1-p,3);\n    el.textContent=(target*e).toFixed(dec)+suf; if(p<1) requestAnimationFrame(step); };\n  requestAnimationFrame(step);\n});\n\n/* ---------- neural mesh graph ---------- */\n(function(){\n  const NS='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg';\n  const edgesG=document.getElementById('edges'), nodesG=document.getElementById('nodes'), pktG=document.getElementById('packets');\n  const layers=[5,7,7,6,3], xs=[60,185,305,425,520];\n  const nodes=[], edges=[];\n  layers.forEach((n,li)=>{\n    for(let i=0;i<n;i++){\n      const y = 400*( (i+1)/(n+1) ) + (Math.random()*22-11);\n      nodes.push({x:xs[li]+(Math.random()*14-7), y, l:li});\n    }\n  });\n  nodes.forEach((a,ai)=>{\n    nodes.forEach((b,bi)=>{\n      if(b.l===a.l+1 && Math.random()<0.5) edges.push({a:ai,b:bi});\n    });\n  });\n  // guarantee connectivity\n  nodes.forEach((a,ai)=>{\n    if(a.l<layers.length-1 && !edges.some(e=>e.a===ai)){\n      const cand=nodes.map((n,i)=>({n,i})).filter(o=>o.n.l===a.l+1);\n      edges.push({a:ai,b:cand[Math.floor(Math.random()*cand.length)].i});\n    }\n  });\n  edges.forEach(e=>{\n    const l=document.createElementNS(NS,'line');\n    l.setAttribute('x1',nodes[e.a].x);l.setAttribute('y1',nodes[e.a].y);\n    l.setAttribute('x2',nodes[e.b].x);l.setAttribute('y2',nodes[e.b].y);\n    l.setAttribute('stroke', Math.random()<.5?'rgba(255,91,100,.22)':'rgba(140,20,255,.16)');\n    l.setAttribute('stroke-width','1');\n    edgesG.appendChild(l);\n  });\n  nodes.forEach((n,i)=>{\n    const last = n.l===layers.length-1;\n    const c=document.createElementNS(NS,'circle');\n    c.setAttribute('cx',n.x);c.setAttribute('cy',n.y);\n    c.setAttribute('r', last?7.5:(n.l===0?4.5:5.5));\n    c.setAttribute('fill', last?'url(#core)':(n.l%2?'#ff5b64':'#8c14ff'));\n    c.setAttribute('filter','url(#glow)');\n    c.setAttribute('opacity','.9');\n    if(!reduce){\n      const a=document.createElementNS(NS,'animate');\n      a.setAttribute('attributeName','opacity');\n      a.setAttribute('values','.45;1;.45');\n      a.setAttribute('dur',(2+Math.random()*2.6).toFixed(2)+'s');\n      a.setAttribute('begin',(Math.random()*3).toFixed(2)+'s');\n      a.setAttribute('repeatCount','indefinite');\n      c.appendChild(a);\n    }\n    nodesG.appendChild(c);\n    const r=document.createElementNS(NS,'circle');\n    r.setAttribute('cx',n.x);r.setAttribute('cy',n.y);r.setAttribute('r',last?13:10);\n    r.setAttribute('fill','none');r.setAttribute('stroke', n.l%2?'rgba(255,91,100,.25)':'rgba(140,20,255,.22)');\n    r.setAttribute('stroke-width','.8');\n    nodesG.insertBefore(r,c);\n  });\n\n  const packets=[]; let last=performance.now(), acc=0, sent=0, secAcc=0;\n  const pktLabel=document.getElementById('pkt');\n  function spawn(){\n    if(packets.length>34) return;\n    const e=edges[Math.floor(Math.random()*edges.length)];\n    const c=document.createElementNS(NS,'circle');\n    c.setAttribute('r','2.6');\n    c.setAttribute('fill', Math.random()<.55?'#8c14ff':'#ff5b64');\n    c.setAttribute('filter','url(#glow)');\n    pktG.appendChild(c);\n    packets.push({e,t:0,sp:0.9+Math.random()*1.3,el:c}); sent++;\n  }\n  function loop(now){\n    const dt=Math.min((now-last)/1000,.05); last=now; acc+=dt; secAcc+=dt;\n    while(acc>0.055){ spawn(); acc-=0.055; }\n    for(let i=packets.length-1;i>=0;i--){\n      const p=packets[i]; p.t+=dt*p.sp;\n      const a=nodes[p.e.a], b=nodes[p.e.b];\n      if(p.t>=1){ p.el.remove(); packets.splice(i,1); continue; }\n      p.el.setAttribute('cx', a.x+(b.x-a.x)*p.t);\n      p.el.setAttribute('cy', a.y+(b.y-a.y)*p.t);\n      p.el.setAttribute('opacity', (Math.sin(p.t*Math.PI)).toFixed(2));\n    }\n    if(secAcc>1){ pktLabel.textContent = sent + ' pkt/s'; sent=0; secAcc=0; }\n    requestAnimationFrame(loop);\n  }\n  if(!reduce) requestAnimationFrame(loop); else pktLabel.textContent='18 pkt/s';\n})();\n\n/* ---------- agent roster ---------- */\nconst AGENTS=[\n  {n:'VESPER',  r:'Planner / orchestrator', s:'run',  load:78, tok:'412k', code:'V7'},\n  {n:'HALCYON', r:'Retrieval · vector mesh', s:'run',  load:64, tok:'298k', code:'H3'},\n  {n:'OBSIDIAN',r:'Code executor · microVM', s:'sync', load:41, tok:'187k', code:'O1'},\n  {n:'LUMEN',   r:'Critic · guardrails',     s:'run',  load:55, tok:'240k', code:'L5'},\n  {n:'NOCTIS',  r:'Long-term memory',        s:'idle', load:12, tok:'31k',  code:'N2'}\n];\nconst agentsEl=document.getElementById('agents');\nagentsEl.innerHTML=AGENTS.map((a,i)=>`\n  <div class=\"agent\">\n    <div class=\"top\">\n      <div class=\"av\">${a.code}</div>\n      <div><h4>${a.n}</h4><div class=\"role\">${a.r}</div></div>\n      <span class=\"chip ${a.s}\">${a.s==='run'?'running':a.s==='sync'?'syncing':'idle'}</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"meter\"><i style=\"width:${a.load}%\" data-load=\"${i}\"></i></div>\n    <div class=\"mrow\"><span>LOAD <b class=\"lv-${i}\">${a.load}%</b></span><span>CTX <b>${a.tok}</b></span><span>ERR <b>0</b></span></div>\n    <svg class=\"spark\" viewBox=\"0 0 200 28\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <polyline class=\"spk-${i}\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"${i%2?'#ff5b64':'#8c14ff'}\" stroke-width=\"1.4\" opacity=\".85\" points=\"\"/>\n    </svg>\n  </div>`).join('');\n\nfunction sparkPts(seed){\n  let p=[];\n  for(let x=0;x<=200;x+=10){\n    p.push(x+','+(14 + Math.sin((x+seed)/18)*7 + (Math.random()*7-3.5)).toFixed(1));\n  }\n  return p.join(' ');\n}\nAGENTS.forEach((a,i)=>document.querySelector('.spk-'+i).setAttribute('points',sparkPts(i*30)));\nif(!reduce) setInterval(()=>{\n  AGENTS.forEach((a,i)=>{\n    if(a.s==='idle') return;\n    a.load=Math.max(8,Math.min(96, a.load + Math.round(Math.random()*16-8)));\n    document.querySelector(`[dat